{"id":"fe4afc670ec37a7e","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-ito-isometry.md","title":"Itô Isometry","display":"thm-ito-isometry — Itô Isometry","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ito-isometry","aliases":["58-thm-ito-isometry"],"display":"thm-ito-isometry — Itô Isometry","depends_on":["[[58-df-stochastic-integral]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ito-isometry"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ito-isometry</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ito-isometry — Itô Isometry"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"263379658f1ae518\" href=\"?note=263379658f1ae518\" title=\"58-df-stochastic-integral\">58-df-stochastic-integral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b91a21e76d0947e0\" href=\"?note=b91a21e76d0947e0\" title=\"58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md\">58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(Y,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>积分关系沿用原固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的七元接口；两个平方范数值关系见 <code>58-df-stochastic-integral-data</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b91a21e76d0947e0\" href=\"?note=b91a21e76d0947e0\" title=\"58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md\">58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ito\\text{-}isometry}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t(Y,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S(r,Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ito\\text{-}isometry}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t(Y,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S(r,Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原适应性假设不能替代相对于整个指定滤过的增量独立性；此条件现已在定理前提中明确。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-stochastic-integral","status":"resolved","id":"263379658f1ae518","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-stochastic-integral]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}$、$\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}$、$\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}$ 取 [[58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"Y,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ito\\text{-}isometry}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t(Y,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S(r,Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1341,"backlinks":[{"id":"c9068a8f2385d816","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id"